  "title": "Febe Osnaps And Basic Smarttrack",
  "status": "AUTOMATED_TARGET_VALIDATED_MANUAL_UI_PENDING",
  "summary": "No object-snap/SmartTrack engine existed; only disabled icons. Implemented the pure Rust snap query (End/Mid/Center/Quadrant/Point/Intersection/Near/Tangent/Perpendicular/Surface), deterministic priority and one-shot state, transient SmartTrack guides/inference, and the viewport marker/click integration. Added 15 focused tests plus the existing viewport regressions.",
  "audit_result": {
    "existing_implementation": "MISSING_ENGINE",
    "gaps_found": [
      "No osnap candidate query over the captured scene.",
      "No near/intersection/tangent/perpendicular math for the documented geometry.",
      "No BRep display surface snap.",
      "No priority or one-shot override state machine.",
      "No SmartTrack anchors/guides/inferred point.",
      "No snap marker, tooltip or click-path consumption."
    ],
    "gaps_closed": "all"
  },
  "code_changes": [
    "crates/om9-scene/src/osnap.rs (new): SnapKind, SnapSettings, SnapCandidate, SnapState, SmartTrack, candidates/choose and geometry solvers",
    "crates/om9-scene/src/lib.rs: pub mod osnap",
    "crates/om9-app/src/ui.rs: snap/snap_state/smarttrack fields, hover/click consumption, marker + guides painting, Escape clear, public snap controls",
    "crates/om9-app/src/ui/sidebar_palettes.rs: osnap palette icons toggle persistent kinds",
    "crates/om9-scene/tests/osnap.rs (new): 11 scene/geometry tests",
    "crates/om9-app/tests/osnap_ui.rs (new): 3 marker/click/SmartTrack UI tests",
    "crates/om9-app/tests/osnap_brep.rs (new): 1 trimmed BRep surface test"
